            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "b2c8d8dfa6374dd7f0188ad905d16666f04292ec5f8dfb19c66a5ee32f5ce672",
            "start": 1126,
            "end": 1233,
            "quote": "## 4. [别再手动挂载NPU了！手把手教你用Ascend-Docker ...](https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_42662605/article/details/160468881)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-13",
            "event_id": "call_9582efb775754113ac802625.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "b2c8d8dfa6374dd7f0188ad905d16666f04292ec5f8dfb19c66a5ee32f5ce672",
            "start": 259,
            "end": 328,
            "quote": "MindCluster Ascend Docker Runtime （容器引擎插件）为训推任务提供容器化支持，自动挂载所需文件和设备依赖。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "call_9582efb775754113ac802625.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "b2c8d8dfa6374dd7f0188ad905d16666f04292ec5f8dfb19c66a5ee32f5ce672",
            "start": 1554,
            "end": 1590,
            "quote": "它是昇腾官方提供的一个 Docker 运行时插件，装好之后，你只需要 …",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c40628a92ae8ae2d9f769e25093557ad6eebcb1dd2b5047205bbd23a64434675",
            "start": 596,
            "end": 688,
            "quote": "--device /dev/davinci_manager`\\n   - `--device /dev/devmm_svm`\\n   - `--device /dev/hisi_hdc",
            "json_escaped": true
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c40628a92ae8ae2d9f769e25093557ad6eebcb1dd2b5047205bbd23a64434675",
            "start": 950,
            "end": 1015,
            "quote": "用 `docker run --runtime=ascend` 即可自动挂载 NPU 设备和驱动，无需手动 `--device`。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "call_91417b5b586247da97c6c088.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "5c1cad117a32f09e3dfcb2757d426366b354c0d7b78ec368aaff186a63315897",
            "start": 1127,
            "end": 1153,
            "quote": "- /dev/devmm_svm：内存管理相关设备。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "a5f30b5eec8fc6bce9084c27aa12385361d7efd9b937b6a00c456e38215278f6",
            "start": 280,
            "end": 346,
            "quote": "PyTorch 2.3.1 ↔ torch-npu 2.3.1 ↔ CANN 8.0.RC2，支持 x86-64 / aarch64",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "a5f30b5eec8fc6bce9084c27aa12385361d7efd9b937b6a00c456e38215278f6",
            "start": 2062,
            "end": 2110,
            "quote": "Ascend-docker-runtime_<version>_linux-<arch>.run",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "a5f30b5eec8fc6bce9084c27aa12385361d7efd9b937b6a00c456e38215278f6",
            "start": 548,
            "end": 617,
            "quote": "docker run \\\n    --name cann_container \\\n    --device /dev/davinci1 \\",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
